REPORT FORMATTING & COLOUR HIGHLIGHTING RULES
==================================================

The validation report must visually highlight mismatches exactly like a manually reviewed Business Analyst validation report.

For every FAIL record:

Highlight ONLY the cells that contain the mismatch.

Do NOT colour the entire row unless all columns are affected.

Colouring Rules:

RED FILL
Use RED fill for actual mismatches:

- Field name mismatch
- Path mismatch
- Data Type mismatch
- Mandatory/Optional parameter mismatch
- Case sensitivity mismatch
- Tag name mismatch
- Missing field in RAML
- Missing field in Mapping Document
- Duplicate block present in RAML
- Description tag not present in RAML
- Data type missing from Mapping Document
